   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We will replace the last linear layer with our own classification layer. From the output above we get the dimensions:\n",
    "\n",
    "`(6): Linear(in_features=4096, out_features=1000, bias=True)`\n",
    "\n",
    "So we output 1000 classes, but we want to change to 5."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "metadata": {},
